Package: thalnative
Type: Package
Title: Native R Implementation of T-HAL-MLE for Dose-Response Curves
Version: 0.0.1
Date: 2026-10-11
Authors@R: person("Pedro", "Sordo Martinez", email = "amurlaniakea@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implementation of Targeted Highly Adaptive Lasso Minimum Loss Estimation 
    (T-HAL-MLE) for continuous dose-response curves. 100 percent R base with no external 
    dependencies. Includes native LASSO via coordinate descent, HAL basis construction, 
    and influence curve-based inference.
